-intelligence/1007664/samsungs-chip-business-continues-to-print-money" target="_blank" rel="noopener">predicted</a>, Samsung reported record quarterly revenue of 195.3 trillion Korean Won ($146.3 billion), and said its 2027 supply of HBM RAM is already sold out.</p></div></div><div class="_1p001ee0"><div class="_1y5ugvbe"><div class="_1y5ugvb9"><a class="_1y5ugvba" href="https://wccftech.com/samsung-memory-shortages-worse-in-2027-supply-constraints-persist-into-2028/" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Samsung Says Memory Shortages Will Get Worse in 2027 &amp; Supply Constraints Will Persist Into 2028, Up To 70% Capacity Secured By Long-Term Agreement Customers</a><p class="_1y5ugvbb">[<!-- -->Wccftech<!-- -->]</p></div></div></div></div><div class="dq5wa40"><span class="dq5wa41"><span class="_4zezgs7 _4zezgs2"><a class="duet--article--comments-link _4zezgsc" href="/tech/1022242/samsungs-expecting-the-ram-shortage-to-last-until-at-least-2028#comments"><svg class="_4zezgs13" width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Comments</title><desc>Comment Icon Bubble</desc><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.8999 2.10001C2.76729 2.10001 2.64012 2.15268 2.54635 2.24645C2.45258 2.34022 2.3999 2.4674 2.3999 2.60001V9.3929L3.6928 8.10001H9.8999C10.0325 8.10001 10.1597 8.04733 10.2535 7.95356C10.3472 7.85979 10.3999 7.73261 10.3999 7.60001V2.60001C10.3999 2.4674 10.3472 2.34022 10.2535 2.24645C10.1597 2.15268 10.0325 2.10001 9.8999 2.10001H2.8999ZM1.83924 1.53935C2.12055 1.25804 2.50208 1.10001 2.8999 1.10001H9.8999C10.2977 1.10001 10.6793 1.25804 10.9606 1.53935C11.2419 1.82065 11.3999 2.20218 11.3999 2.60001V7.60001C11.3999 7.99783 11.2419 8.37936 10.9606 8.66067C10.6793 8.94197 10.2977 9.10001 9.8999 9.10001H4.10701L1.3999 11.8071V2.60001C1.3999 2.20218 1.55794 1.82065 1.83924 1.53935Z"></path></svg><span class="_4zezgs14"><span>7</span></span></a></span></span><span class="_1044qizr"></span><